    "notes": "A sixteenth-note funk groove whose bass line is written out: thumbed roots, popped octaves and ghosted dead notes. Play it on a bass (P-Bass Flatwound or J-Style Fingerstyle) with slap on; on a guitar it goes out as MIDI.",
